 "stimulus_html": "Assume <span data-math=\"p\">p</span> is true and <span data-math=\"q\">q</span> is false:  <span data-math=\"p{\\text{:}}\">p:</span> The contractor  fixed the broken window, and <span data-math=\"q{\\text{:}}\">q:</span> The homeowner paid the contractor $200. Create a truth table to determine the truth value of each of the following biconditional statements.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 497179,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"p \\leftrightarrow q\">p \\leftrightarrow q</span>",
