     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Since you are told to assume <span data-math=\"p\"></span> is true and <span data-math=\"q\"></span> is false, you only need one row of possible truth values in your truth table.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"p\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"p \\leftrightarrow {\\text{~}}q\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span></p>\n<p>Since <span data-math=\"q\"></span> is false, <span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span> is true. Write T under <span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"p\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"p \\leftrightarrow {\\text{~}}q\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"p \\leftrightarrow {\\text{~}}q\"></span></p>\n<p>A biconditional is true when the two statements have the same truth value. Otherwise, it is false.</p>\n<p>Since <span data-math=\"p\"></span> and <span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span> are both true, the biconditional is true. Write a T in the last column.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"p\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{~}}q\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"p \\leftrightarrow {\\text{~}}q\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>T</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The statement is true because there is a T in the last column.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "True\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span data-math=\"p\">p</span></th>\n<th><span data-math=\"q\">q</span></th>\n<th><span data-math=\"\\text{~}{q}\">\\text{~}{q}</span></th>\n<th><span data-math=\"{p} \\leftrightarrow \\text{~}{q}\">{p} \\leftrightarrow \\text{~}{q}</span></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>T</td>\n<td><b>T</b></td>\n</tr>\n</thead></table>"
    }
